description=System tweaks: I/O scheduler, component disable, appops, game mode, optional auto Private DNS (Wi-Fi/mobile) and a network engine (profiles, per-app boost/isolate). Run-on-demand; no resident process unless the optional watcher or Auto Private DNS is enabled. Includes a fingerprint-locked Zygisk fix for a SystemUI MediaMetadata NPE crash (Infinix X6815B, firmware 231020V486 only — inert no-op elsewhere). v1.3: added Auto Private DNS (yay_dns). v1.4: faster handover, smoother WebUI, watcher flag survives updates. v1.5: network engine (PingPimp port).
updateJson=
